    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kūpyenwa na Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli a bose bandya kūgūpandīka ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya ng'wa Sang'weli. Ū mu shikū jenījo a Baisilaeli bakingīla mu būlūgū wa kwilwisha na Bafilisiti; būūkakoma ng'hambī yabo Ebenezeeli, a Bafilisiti būkoma ī ng'hambī yabo Afeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti bilwisha nabo a Baisilaeli; ū būlūgū aho waseba gete a Baisilaeli būtindwa. Banhū babo ba kūshika gītī shihūmbī shinè būbūlagwa na Bafilisiti ū kū būlūgū kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshoka ū kū ng'hambī a bashilikale, a banamhala ba Baisilaeli bibūūja, “Nibūlī ī lelo ū SEEBA watūtūūla mu būpyenwa būtaale gīkī ū kū būtongi wa Bafilisiti? Tūjagi ī Shilo tūkalyenhe ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA, lībize ū kū būtongi wise, atūpīje ū mu nkono gwa banishi bise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būtūma banhū ī Shilo būūkalyenha ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA ū Ndūji wa shose, ūyo isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi līlī ha gatī gatī ya makelubi. Na a bitūnja ba ng'wa Eli a ba Hofuni nū Finehasi būja kwikala nalyo ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ū mu ng'hambī ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA, pye a Baisilaeli būyega no, būyoga na'ilaka lya higūlya no no no, kūshisha ī sī yūtingina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti aho bīyiigwa ī yoge yenīyo būhaya, “Al'ī yombo ī nhaale yenīyo ya kinehe ū kū ng'hambī ya Bahebulania?” Aho badeeba gīkī lizaga isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA ū kū ng'hambī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a Bafilisiti bogoha; bandya kwiwīla, “Biza bamulungu ū mu ng'hambī, twaacha! Gūtaalī kwilonga mhayo gūlī gīko na kamò yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twaashila! Nani akūtūpīja ū mu nkono gwa bamulungu a ba nguzu benaba? A bamulungu benaba angū hū bene abo bakabatūla bana Misili na mahūūya ga būlī mbika ng'witogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we Bafilisiti timbyagi ng'holò mulwe nyagosha, ūlū ng'ūdondosha bakūmusuga a Bahebulania, gīt'ūmo ng'walī mubasugīlile a bing'we; ipandagi chanda mulwe nyagosha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a Bafilisiti būūlwa, būbapyena a Baisilaeli; būlī ng'wene ūpeela kwiheema lyakwe. Ū būbūlagi būbiza būtaale no, a Baisilaeli būjimīīja bashilikale shihūmbī makūmi adatū ba kūshimīza wa magūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA lyūding'wa, pye na a bitūnja ba ng'wa Eli būbīlī wabo, ū Hofuni nū Finehasi, būbūlagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Eli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo munhū ūmò wa mu lūganda lo ng'wa Benjamini ūpeela kūfuma ū kū būlūgū, ūja ī Shilo na shizwalo shakwe shitandagūkile, hama ookalaga lūbuubu ū kū ntwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alīshika, ū Eli walī wigasha hisumbī lyakwe hihī na'ikūūwa alindanile; nguno ī ng'holò yakwe yalī yogoha no kūlwa isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo wahayūshika ū mu nzengo, aho wabawīla īyo yalī yilonga, pyī ū nzengo gūūtandūka kūlīla ng'hūngū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eli aho wīyigwa ī ng'hūngū ūbūūja, “Ni yaakī hangī ī ng'hūngū yenīyo?” Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūja wangū aho walī ū Eli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenījo ū Eli walī namhala wa būlamu wa myaka makūmi anaane na kenda; nīyo na miso gakwe gaalī gooya ū kūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū Eli, “Baba nafuma ū kū būlūgū ī haha yenīyī,” nīnga ko lelo īyī, niza nalīpeela. Ū Eli ūbūūja, “Yaja ko kinehe ng'wana wane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo akeenha mhola ūhaya, “A Bafilisiti babapeeja a Baisilaeli; nī libità lyajimīīja banhū bingī no. Na a bitūnja bako, ū Hofuni nū Finehasi baacha; nī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA lyading'wa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho walīhaya dūhū ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA, ū namhala Eli ūgwa sagaalī ū kūfuma a h'isumbī lyakwe. Walī bbihī na mita, ūgwīla henaho ūbīnzīka ī nhingo ūcha, nguno walī namhala; hangī ū mīlī gwakwe gwalī ndito. A Baisilaeli walī wabatongeela ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho na ng'wīnga wakwe, nke o ng'wa Finehasi, walī nda ya bbihī kūbyala; aho wajipandīka ī mhola gīkī lyadimagwa ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA, nū ise būkwi waacha; nū ngoshi wachīlaga kū būlūgū, ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūlung'wa būsūngū wa kūbyala ī likanza lyenīlo; alīyo ū būsūngū būbiza wakīlanīja no, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būmūlaga. Aho alī ng'wikanza lya kūcha a bakīma abo bangunanhaga būng'wīla, “Timbyaga ng'holò wabyala ng'wana ngosha.” Alīyo atoolekegije gīkī akabigwa nūūlū kūbashokeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wana ūng'wilīka lina lya Ikaboodi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikaboodi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Ndūhū ikūjo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūnū alīhaya; “Lyīngaga ī likūjo ū mu Isilaeli!” Nguno ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu lyalī lyading'wa, nū nkwiye ūcha hamò nū ngoshi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu lyadimagwa, lyīngaga ī likūjo ū mu Baisilaeli!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
